<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese Maritime Militia vessels continue to conduct dangerous maneuvers against Philippine patrol assets, including the BRP Cabra and its RHIB, while repelling two militia vessels that anchored illegally in the West Philippine Sea. The Philippines has expanded maritime cooperation, conducting joint naval exercises with France in the Sulu Sea and adding five new Coast Guard vessels through a partnership with Japan. Finland has signed a maritime security pact that involves Australian support for drones and cybersecurity. 176 battle-related deaths were reported in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxON0hIdGFSUXg2MGZnSENfR285MHJwUnIyOEdtWXlqS1lDVEZYajhqRDdTQ1lEYXRRZDJVWjZvN29KVEYxcWhyY2VSbE1TbHYzbzBOTV9MaUlUdWlFSmMyTVBsNjNTUXoyTnd0UmdyRktFWWVBTmtUUTR4TXI5eU1aYlQtaTdudkYwN0Uxc2c1ZHAzcFJEdXJ5aVRqb28wamlOWTdRU0g4ZG1ITWJPMWgyVDE4VQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Maritime Executive&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNem96aFIxS1RvTFp5VndYTDY0X2d4T3pnV0phQmhOMUthV0NpMkcweDJVQVVkd0VFdEFOVFRyeWEtYUEtRV82bENvbENPMmJGdkR1cXRXQWVVNVlQNG95VldFczMwamtqOGVlTTNDLVJ4UFQyT1puNEpBdkRnNnFWVjEycEhFTlNKcTNGcjQ5MzlxX0ZmUGpXZkJxYklpam1tWXVfMU05V3E0NTFZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABS-CBN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPTi1BM1FBOTVnS2hHV3U5UnJMT0JYTTB4QlVub0o1TW8zMDd1Y0MyRUM4RkxjM1NELVg3UXU3ZEtfYzVfb1pCYkpBMmtKT25yQ09fTUNLRkRYT2IyRzVBNnlzT1VWYjVTUFVIRGZ4THg4LVZrMmFmSDhnUjZyUXdTY2UwaUpqeXl4TTZCbHNnWjRfakRyR0RJcEtfZks3R3pRT0h2SXI2Tmx1MVVrZVBMMXpRcFRIRkpIdVFPWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNbElFLW1FOExYRjhIZHRVZWMxbXRQemhPSkJXb29fWEJhNFV4b3ZVbktmaTNYOS1MdTh5dGxIMXBMZnY3QlRUb